            "EvaluationDetails": "Evaluated by: StandardPolicyEvaluationEngine`1\n-------------------------------------------------------\nAllOf : NonCompliant : GHActionsWorkflows - WorkflowsYaml Match (Arachni|ecsypno|scnr|portswigger|Burp) (Actual: -Workflow# .github/workflows/upload-sarif.yml [[##STARTupload-sarif.yml]] # GitHub Actions workflow to upload SARIF files to GitHub Code Scanning\n# This enables viewing DevOps Shield security assessment results in the Security tab\n\nname: Upload SARIF to Code Scanning\n\non:\n  push:\n    branches: [main]\n    paths:\n      - 'docs/sarif/*.sarif'\n      - 'sarif-results/*.sarif'\n  pull_request:\n    branches: [main]\n    paths:\n      - 'docs/sarif/*.sarif'\n      - 'sarif-results/*.sarif'\n  workflow_dispatch:\n    inputs:\n      sarif_file:\n        description: 'Path to SARIF file to upload'\n        required: false\n        default: 'sarif-results/devops-shield-assessment.sarif'\n      category:\n        description: 'Category for Code Scanning'\n        required: false\n        default: 'devops-shield-sarif-export-test'\n\npermissions:\n  contents: read\n  security-events: write\n  actions: read\n\njobs:\n  upload-sarif:\n    name: Upload SARIF\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n\n    steps:\n      - name: Checkout repos ...)\n-------------------------------------------------------\nResult: NonCompliant\n",
